WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.988
Lab 1 needs only a laptop: PowerShell
7 and Pester, no tenant, no network.

2
00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:10.711
First you run Learn's own samples against
the stand-ins, and one test shows what

3
00:00:10.711 --> 00:00:15.362
you'd otherwise take on trust: the
eligible-only holders simply never appear.

4
00:00:15.362 --> 00:00:19.138
Then you list the permissions,
five of them, and none can write.

5
00:00:19.138 --> 00:00:24.174
Finally you run the inventory against a
fictional tenant with three Azure scopes.

6
00:00:24.174 --> 00:00:27.819
It returns thirty rows across
the tiers, ten findings,

7
00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:30.800
seven warnings and one informational item.

8
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.520
Let's read those findings.
